From f13587828bc0b4fc2aed3f8b932b87b6339895b0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Z User <z@container>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 23:22:26 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] refactor: remove 10 dead providers + 2 dead classes (197
 lines removed)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Audit found 20 providers defined but never used in any app screen.
After deeper analysis:
  - 10 are TRULY DEAD (0 refs anywhere) → REMOVED
  - 10 are used INTERNALLY (cache invalidation in mutations) → KEPT

## Removed (10 providers + 2 classes = 197 lines)

### query_providers_wali.dart (−88 lines)
- perkembanganQuranAnakProvider — 0 refs (wali reads via santriDetail tab instead)
- hafalanKitabAnakProvider — 0 refs (same)
- akhlakAnakProvider — 0 refs (same)
- pembinaanAnakProvider — 0 refs (same)

### providers_admin_keuangan.dart (−20 lines)
- qrScanListAdminProvider — 0 refs (QR scan feature uses screen-local provider)
- QRScanAdminModel class — only used by qrScanListAdminProvider (removed together)

### storage_service.dart (−14 lines)
- storageBucketConfigProvider — 0 refs (StorageBucketConfig.configs map used directly)
- storageListProvider — 0 refs (list() method called directly via storageServiceProvider)

### api_client.dart (−78 lines)
- dioProvider — 0 refs (legacy Phase 1 Dio HTTP client, replaced by Supabase client)
- apiClientConfigProvider — only used by dioProvider (dead chain)
- authTokenProvider — only used by dioProvider (dead chain)
- ApiClientConfig class — only used by apiClientConfigProvider (dead chain)
- Unused Dio import removed

## Kept (10 providers — used internally for cache invalidation)
- chatMessagesProvider — ref.invalidate() in sendChatMessage (guru)
- chatMessagesWaliProvider — ref.invalidate() in sendChatMessage (wali)
- guruListProvider — ref.invalidate() in invalidateAllQueries
- otpVerifyTokenProvider — used in setNewPin (OTP verify flow)
- permissionsByModuleProvider — ref.invalidate() in grant/revokePermission
- realtimeChannelsProvider — used in setupAppRealtime + disposeAppRealtime
- roleByIdProvider — used in mutation_providers_admin (4 refs)
- systemSettingByKeyProvider — used in admin settings (3 refs)
- userByIdProvider — used in admin mutations (3 refs)
- userCountProvider — used in admin dashboard stats (2 refs)

## Verification
All 12 removed items verified to have 0 references remaining (no broken imports).
